y_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"gurR2NBF1RA-l--XLYV17Q","review_id":"TdRdrdZpkwDR0v1n_3vPow","date":"2020-01-11T21:22:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9335759878158569,"text_excerpt":"Very obsessed with Lamara. I almost don't want to tell people about it! I don't often hang out at coffee shops/cafes but I wanted to treat myself to breakfast the other day while running errands in Mid-City. I hit the jackpot with Lamara! First off, this place has VIBES. It is large, open, bright, and clean. Seating is plentiful. Tables are not on top of each other. Seating varies from high top chairs at a bar facing a beautiful moss art piece, small 2 person tables (with chairs or old church pews as seating), and a long family style table in the middle which I thought was a charming touch. There is ALSO an outdoor patio in the back where dogs are apparently welcome. The music was soft an..."},{"business_id":"gurR2NBF1RA-l--XLYV17Q","review_id":"i4qtoz4GjSLTPWytoVTsNA","date":"2021-06-22T02:38:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9274428486824036,"text_excerpt":"We had a GREAT time at Lamara Coffee! I went with a few of my sisters and my mom for lunch on a random Monday. We got everything vegan pretty much and loved it all!! The grab and go fridge with the Buffalo tofu wrap and another vegan wrap and a bunch of vegan salads and juices was just amazing! That would make the perfect spot to pick up a quick lunch on the way to work or a tour. We also got the eggplant sandwich and two of the vegan burgers. The burgers were soooo good!!! They had an awesome sauce and blue corn chips on the burger was a really tasty touch. There's a huge outdoor patio with lots of shaded seating. We enjoyed the outdoor patio despite the heat. We also had a few of the be..."},{"business_id":"gurR2NBF1RA-l--XLYV17Q","review_id":"GfZ6foVjcx1RNyHYyzW_UQ","date":"2020-12-16T19:10:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9267914295196533,"text_excerpt":"This place has good vibes and a good environment. There are places to work inside and an outdoor area in the back. Although I did enjoy the iced matcha latte I got, it felt a bit pricey to me. They had a large menu of smoothies that I am interested in trying out later. I appreciate the sustainability aspect of their store."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"gurR2NBF1RA-l--XLYV17Q","photo_id":"8ag0j59u6DAmiNCWQ2K8gA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8ag0j59u6DAmiNCWQ2K8gA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.945698082447052},{"business_id":"gurR2NBF1RA-l--XLYV17Q","photo_id":"GckUw782mtVxvK5BNSRcLw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/GckUw782mtVxvK5BNSRcLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8568862676620483},{"business_id":"gurR2NBF1RA-l--XLYV17Q","photo_id":"YJ2UNQVELjC5L-h_2net-A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/YJ2UNQVELjC5L-h_2net-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8095703721046448}]},"notebook_case":null}
